  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Misc costs election observation - Misc costs election observatio</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xD6;vriga kost f&#xF6;r valobservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regeringen fattar beslut om svenskt deltagande i  valobservationsinsatser. Ut&#xF6;ver de kostnader som belastar landram/region anslag kan det uppst&#xE5; kostnader som ej omfattas av regeringsbeslut, s&#xE5; som kostnader f&#xF6;r utbildning av valobservat&#xF6;rer som anordnas av EU. Det kan &#xE4;ven uppst&#xE5; f&#xF6;rberedelsekostnader f&#xF6;r planerade insatser som senare ej fullf&#xF6;ljs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The government decides on Swedish participation in electionmissions. In addition to the costs borne countryframe appropriation, there may be expenses not covered by government decisions, such as costs for training of election observers organized by the EU. It can also occur preparation costs for the planned actions subsequently not pursued.</narrative>
  </description>
